      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.291,
          "end": 3.44,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] Now to get started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.44,
          "end": 6.49,
          "en": "I created a brand new expo project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.49,
          "end": 9.13,
          "en": "and you find my project attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.13,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "So that you can use the same starting point as I did.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 16.1,
          "en": "It's a very simple app with only one component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.1,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "The app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "with some dummy content and some basic styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 25.323,
          "en": "This will be our starting point for this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.45,
          "end": 28.21,
          "en": "Now in this course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.21,
          "end": 29.77,
          "en": "we're going to build this game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.77,
          "end": 32.01,
          "en": "which I already showed you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.01,
          "end": 35.29,
          "en": "This game of course has multiple screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.29,
          "end": 38.5,
          "en": "It has this starting screen, where we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.5,
          "end": 43.44,
          "en": "as the owner of the phone, pick a number between one and 99.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.44,
          "end": 47.4,
          "en": "And on this screen, we want to do a couple of things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.4,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "We want to ensure that no number smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 53.2,
          "en": "than one or bigger than 99 can be picked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.2,
          "end": 54.82,
          "en": "for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.82,
          "end": 58.95,
          "en": "We also then want to allow the user to reset this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 62.35,
          "en": "and pick a new number, or finally start a game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.35,
          "end": 65.35,
          "en": "at which point we'll navigate to the game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.35,
          "end": 68.453,
          "en": "The second main screen we have in this game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.41,
          "end": 70.53,
          "en": "On this screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.53,
          "end": 73.89,
          "en": "the phone will guess the number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.89,
          "end": 77.32,
          "en": "and we have to tell the phone after every guess,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.32,
          "end": 79.9,
          "en": "if it should guess lower or higher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.9,
          "end": 82.27,
          "en": "to get closer to our number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.27,
          "end": 84.28999999999999,
          "en": "Now on this screen, we for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.28999999999999,
          "end": 87.34,
          "en": "show a little alert, a little a warning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.34,
          "end": 89.5,
          "en": "If we give the phone a wrong hint.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.5,
          "end": 93.02000000000001,
          "en": "If our chosen number is smaller and we tell the phone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.02000000000001,
          "end": 95.27000000000001,
          "en": "that it's bigger, something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.27000000000001,
          "end": 99.22999999999999,
          "en": "Now, besides that every guess by the phone is logged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.22999999999999,
          "end": 103.53999999999999,
          "en": "and we see our log here, and this log also is scrollable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.53999999999999,
          "end": 107.44,
          "en": "In case we exceed the max available height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.44,
          "end": 110.56,
          "en": "Last but not least, once the phone guess our number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.56,
          "end": 112.47,
          "en": "We get this Game Over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.47,
          "end": 115,
          "en": "with a short summary and this nice image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115,
          "end": 116.69,
          "en": "And then from that screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.69,
          "end": 119.75999999999999,
          "en": "we can start a new game if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.75999999999999,
          "end": 122.45,
          "en": "And therefore, in this starting app here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.45,
          "end": 124.73,
          "en": "we will have to add all these screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.73,
          "end": 128.07,
          "en": "but also plenty of other reusable components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.07,
          "end": 131.25,
          "en": "Like the buttons we have, because we will build those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 134.94,
          "en": "from scratch ourselves and many other things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.94,
          "end": 136.51,
          "en": "And therefore, that's what we'll do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.51,
          "end": 138.86,
          "en": "for the rest of this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.86,
          "end": 141.88,
          "en": "Now, if you're feeling super fancy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.88,
          "end": 145.48,
          "en": "definitely try building a first prototype of this game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.48,
          "end": 147.75,
          "en": "on your own with the basic React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.75,
          "end": 150.74,
          "en": "and React Native knowledge you have up to this point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.74,
          "end": 153.87,
          "en": "You will not be able to recreate the exact same look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.87,
          "end": 156.41,
          "en": "because there are new components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.41,
          "end": 160.13,
          "en": "and new tricks that we will need to build this result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 160.13,
          "end": 162.65,
          "en": "But maybe you can build a basic prototype",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.65,
          "end": 164.63,
          "en": "with React and React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.63,
          "end": 167.69,
          "en": "And if you want to definitely try building this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.69,
          "end": 169.48,
          "en": "on your own first, but of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.48,
          "end": 172.24,
          "en": "otherwise it's perfectly fine to just follow along",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.24,
          "end": 175.55,
          "en": "so that we can build this game together step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.55,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "And at the same time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 179.38,
          "en": "we will learn many new important things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.38,
          "end": 181.263,
          "en": "about React and React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
